为分身替自己驱动 CLI 工具", "description_zh": "OpenClaw AI Code 场景路由器 / 开发任务选型器。OpenClaw 分身模式的大脑——根据任务语义（重构、bugfix、TDD、SDD、Harness、CI、前端、长上下文分析等）自动匹配最优 AI Code CLI 工具和模型，给出可直接执行的命令。\n中文名：AI Code 场景路由器 | AI 编程分身 | 开发任务选型器 | 工具推荐 | 场景匹配\n- MANDATORY TRIGGERS: 帮我选工具、用哪个 CLI、用什么工具、场景路由、选 CLI、最适合、路由、ai-code-router、scenario-router、重构用什么、测试用什么、CI 用什么、分身、替我跑、让openclaw帮我\n- Use when: 用户不知道该用哪个 AI Code CLI、想根据开发场景（重构/bugfix/TDD/CI等）自动选工具和模型、想让 OpenClaw 作为分身替自己驱动 CLI 工具", "downloads": 29, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_9edeacf2/openclaw-code-router", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/a78375f1-773e-4817-b4f3-0557b6afd777.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "true"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "openclaw-ai-code-scenario-router", "ownerName": "user_9edeacf2", "score": 23200, "slug": "openclaw-code-router", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "subCategories": [], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781638926097, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": true, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1781454784277, "description": "Jeff Hawkins's On Intelligence — an executable toolkit for understanding the brain's operating principles, Hawkins's memory-prediction framework, and what in...", "description_zh": "杰夫·霍金斯的《On Intelligence》——一个可执行工具包，帮助理解大脑的运行原理、霍金斯的记忆预测框架及相关内容。", "downloads": 29, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/heardlyapp/on-intelligence", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": 1781454784383, "name": "On Intelligence", "ownerName": "heardlyapp", "score": 6531.531531531531, "slug": "on-intelligence", "source": "clawhub", "stars": 0, "subCategories": [], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781608622761, "upstream_owner_login": "heardlyapp", "upstream_url": "https://clawhub.ai/heardlyapp/on-intelligence", "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1780902276554, "description": "检验检测行业质量控制和数据分析工具箱。覆盖室内质控、室间比对、批次间比对、方法验证、趋势监控五大场景。方法通用，跨领域适用。", "description_zh": "检验检测行业质量控制和数据分析工具箱。覆盖室内质控、室间比对、批次间比对、方法验证、趋势监控五大场景。方法通用，跨领域适用。", "downloads": 28, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_800d68d6/analysis-toolkit", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/f7fabcfa-0496-4dc7-9258-df9b7c751850.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "analysis-toolkit", "ownerName": "user_800d68d6", "score": 3641.0923276983094, "slug": "analysis-toolkit", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "subCategories": [], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781671965953, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "2.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1781057555963, "description": "Manage OneHop Codex model configs entirely through chat. Support four modes: list, sync, switch, and status. List remote supported models, sync one config per model into ~/.codex/onehop, switch by copying a saved model config to ~/.codex/config.toml, and show current model status with a live model test.", "description_zh": "简要说明\n这个 skill 是用来帮你管理 第三方例如OneHop 的模型在codex配置，适合不想手动改配置文件的用户。\n第一步先做什么\n先把你的 baseurl 和 api-key 发到聊天里。\n示例：\nbaseurl https://api.onehop.ai/v1\napi-key 你的密钥\n有了这两个信息之后，skill 才能读取模型、同步配置、检查当前模型状态。\n然后怎么用\n你再在聊天里输入下面几种用法：\nlist：查看BaseURL的可用模型和本地配置\nsync：同步模型配置到本地，同时会备份您的现在在用的Codex的配置文件\nswitch 模型名：切换到指定模型\nstatus：查看当前模型是否正常工作\n推荐顺序：先发 baseurl 和 api-key，然后 list -> sync -> switch 模型名 -> status", "downloads": 28, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_28f82bea/codex-config", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "true"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "OneHop codex config", "ownerName": "user_28f82bea", "score": 5323.19391634981, "slug": "codex-config", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "subCategories": [], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781671527861, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.1"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1781329294784, "description": "Review and proofread formal Chinese long-form documents such as enterprise planning reports, strategic plans, feasibility studies, bidding documents, board-ready reports, and other deliverables that need publication-style checking. Use when the user asks to proofread, review, check formatting, inspect layout, find writing issues, reduce AI-like wording, verify text-table consistency, check punctuation, refresh table-of-contents and page-number issues, or assess whether a document is ready to submit. The skill performs local document analysis only and gives structured correction suggestions without generating unsafe content.", "description_zh": "审阅校对公文类报告 以及其他需要正式校对的中文长文档（可行性研究报告、投标技术方案、党委会/董事会审议版报告等）。 逐字逐句查找错别字、病句、数据口径不一致、政策引用过时、术语不规范、逻辑前后矛盾等问题， 输出按严重程度排序的结构化校对清单，每条给出可直接替换进正文的修改建议。 当用户提到\"校对\"\"审阅\"\"审校\"\"查错\"\"规划报告审查\"\"帮我过一遍\"\"检查这份报告\" \"查漏补缺\"\"规划报告\"\"五年规划\"\"十四五\"\"十五五\"\"可研报告\"\"可行性研究\" \"投标文件校对\"\"战略规划审阅\"\"帮我查查有没有错\"\"格式检查\"\"排版检查\" \"检查格式\"\"帮我检查排版\"\"这份报告格式对不对\"\"规划报告审阅\" \"文风检查\"\"去AI味\"\"帮我检查一下行文\"\"润色\"时触发此技能。 当用户上传 docx/pdf/md 文件并要求检查、审阅、校对或格式审查时，也应触发此技能。 即使用户只是说\"帮我看看这份文件有没有问题\"或\"这份报告能不能直接交\"，也应使用此技能。 支持咨询公司规范化标准， 也可根据用户指定的甲方排版要求进行校对。 不适用于文学创作、小说、散文、诗歌、剧本等非公文类文本的校对。 如果当前项目内容明显属于文学创作类（如项目名含\"写书\"\"小说\"\"故事\"， 或用户要求校对的是章节故事、人物对话、文学作品），不应触发此技能。", "downloads": 28, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_6113fd9f/plan-proofread", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/64ea6fd6-ebe7-418c-af4f-2cafff71f2ec.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "审稿校对word报告", "ownerName": "user_6113fd9f"